          "{G_DRAINAGE}"
        ],
        "sub": "{G6_SEPTIC_TANK}",
        "text": "Septic Tank: The property is connected to a septic tank. This is a private drainage system that treats foul waste before discharging the effluent to a drainage field or other approved outfall. The installation was inspected visually only, and no assessment of its operation or compliance with current environmental regulations was undertaken. The system should be regularly maintained and emptied as recommended. Your legal adviser should confirm ownership, maintenance responsibilities, any permits or exemptions, and compliance with current regulations.",
