        "sub": "{G6_CESSPIT}",
        "text": "Cesspit (Cesspool): The property is connected to a cesspit (cesspool), which is an underground storage tank that collects foul waste and requires regular emptying by a licensed waste contractor. The installation was inspected visually only, and no assessment of its condition or capacity was undertaken. Your legal adviser should confirm ownership, maintenance responsibilities, and any records of regular emptying.",
        "tokens": [],
        "when": [
          "cb_cess_pit",
          "true"
